ip|parsnip]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]], juiced\n*4 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] of water\n*1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n*[[Cookbook:Dehydrated Broth|Soup mix]] (optional)\n\n==Procedure==\n#[[Cookbook:Chopping|Chop]] up the onions, and [[Cookbook:Sautéing|sauté]] them in a pot with the olive oil until the onions are golden.\n#Chop up the apples, the carrot, and the parsnip, and put them into the pot.\n#Put the water, the nutmeg, the soup mix (if you are using the soup mix), lemon juice into the pot.\n#Cook for one hour, or until the carrots are soft.\n#Put the soup into a [[Cookbook:Blender|blender]], and blend it up until it is smooth; there should not be any lumps in it.\n#Serve cold or hot!\n\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parsnip]]\n[[Category:Recipes using nutmeg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Apple Parsnip Soup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 onion","sourceText":"1 onion","amountText":"1 onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 tablespoons olive oil","sourceText":"2 tablespoons olive oil","amountText":"2 tablespoons olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 apples","sourceText":"2 apples","amountText":"2 apples","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 carrot","sourceText":"1 carrot","amountText":"1 carrot","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 parsnip","sourceText":"1 parsnip","amountText":"1 parsnip","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 lemon, juiced","sourceText":"1 lemon, juiced","amountText":"1 lemon, juiced","amoun